  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/wordmarks/outlined/cracked/f32_wordmark.png\" alt=\"信实 32x\"> <br><br>\n<h1 style=\"font-weight:900\"><br>Minecraft 首选的 32x 材质包。</h1>\n<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/faithful-32x-bedrock\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/bedrock_button.png\" alt=\"在此获取基岩版材质包\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><hr><p>独一无二的 Faithful 32x 拥有现代且精细的艺术风格，专注于重新构想纹理而非简单重绘，充分利用了更高分辨率。其显著特点包括有限的调色板和对一致性的追求。<br><br>多年来，这款材质包经历了巨大的演变。自2010年由 Vattic 首次创建以来，它已成为文化标志，受到数百万 Minecraft 玩家的喜爱。准备好成为其中一员了吗？</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/discord_button.png\" alt=\"Discord 服务器\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/website_button.png\" alt=\"官方网站\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">附加信息：</h1><p>如果您有任何反馈、想要报告错误或需要一般帮助，请加入我们的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 服务器，提交 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Faithful-32x-Java/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 问题</a>，或在下方评论。有关商业或分发相关的问题，请参阅我们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252flicense\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">许可协议</a>。<br><br>所有纹理和附加组件均由志愿贡献者利用业余时间提供。任何人都可以通过上方链接的 Discord 服务器提交纹理，或制作<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252faddons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加组件</a>以正式列于我们的网站上。开始前，请确保阅读我们的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.faithfulpack.net%252fpages%252ftextures%252ff32-texturing-guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">纹理制作指南</a>，其中精确概述了此材质包的艺术风格。<br><br>每个材质包均可在我们的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faithful_resource_pack/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252ffaithful_resource_pack%252fsubmissions%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFaithful-Resource-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 中找到，部分材质包还额外列于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fuser%252ffaithful-resource-pack%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCPEDL</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/Faithful_Resource_Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 论坛</a>。<strong>从其他任何网站下载均为非官方、不受支持且可能存在危险！请确保上网安全。</strong></p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我们的其他项目：</h1><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/f64_button.png\" alt=\"信实 64x\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-pa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32_button.png\" alt=\"经典信实 32x\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32j_button.png\" alt=\"经典信实 32x Jappa\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf64j_button.png\" alt=\"经典信实 64x Jappa\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><hr><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:smaller\">Faithful 是一系列开源且由社区驱动的 Minecraft 资源包集合，旨在提供更高分辨率的默认 Minecraft 纹理版本，同时忠实于原始纹理。</div>",
